+      legs by the position played (fct_fixture_player_stats.position_code G/D/M/F -> GK/DEF/MID/ATT) and
+      aggregates each role separately; the 18 benchmark metrics (per-90 + rates) are computed in-position.
+      Atom formulas mirror int_player_season__metrics, so a single-position player's per-90 matches his
+      whole-season per-90 there. No floor here — the benchmark filters minutes >= 270.
+      Grain: (player_sk, season_sk, position_group).
+    config:
+      tags: ["intermediate", "football", "player"]
+    tests:
+      - dbt_utils.unique_combination_of_columns:
+          combination_of_columns: [player_sk, season_sk, position_group]
+    columns:
+      - name: player_sk
+        description: "FK to dim_player."
+        tests: [not_null]
+      - name: season_sk
+        description: "FK to dim_competition_season (encodes the competition-season)."
+        tests: [not_null]
+      - name: league_sk
+        tests: [not_null]
+      - name: league_code
+        description: "Partition key."
+        tests: [not_null]
+      - name: season_api_year
+        tests: [not_null]
